# Deployment artifacts (e.g. habitos-7.10B-deploy.zip) — build outputs
# prepared for manual Hostinger upload, never versioned. Narrow pattern
# (not a blanket *.zip) so any future intentionally-versioned ZIP isn't
# silently hidden.
habitos-*-deploy.zip

